# Flutter host-specific generated tooling — regenerated by `flutter pub get`
# on every host (absolute pub-cache paths, host Flutter version, build env), so
# tracking them produces per-host churn that breaks fleet reconcile. Flutter's
# own templates already mark these "do not check into version control".
**/.flutter-plugins
**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
**/Flutter/ephemeral/
**/flutter/ephemeral/
